"""Deterministic bidirectional translation boundary for EL Bot.

1 = emoji/symbol -> text
2 = text -> canonical EL

AI/model inference is intentionally forbidden here. Screenshot AI lives behind
the screenshot-only vision boundary and may only supply observations to this
system. Passing 🔀 returns ranked candidates as JSON. Passing ✅ records an
explicit user selection as observed ranking evidence.
"""

